<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>My Nature Explorer Page</title>

  <link rel="stylesheet"
        href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@4.5.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css">
  
  <style>
    body {
      background-color: #0f172a;
      color: #f8fafc;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }
    .card-box {
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="container-fluid bg-secondary text-white p-4 text-center">
    <h1 class="display-4 font-weight-bold">My Nature Explorer Page</h1>
    <p class="lead">Discover Earth's vibrant ecosystems, wild habitats, and natural wonders.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="container">

    <div class="bg-dark text-white p-4 my-3 border border-success card-box">
      <h2 class="text-success">Rainforest Canopy</h2>
      <p>
        Rainforests generate vast amounts of oxygen and host more than half of the world's plant and animal species.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-dark text-white p-4 my-3 border border-info card-box">
      <h2 class="text-info">Ocean Depths</h2>
      <p>
        Oceans cover over 70% of Earth's surface, regulating global climate and supporting diverse marine life.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-dark text-white p-4 my-3 border border-warning card-box">
      <h2 class="text-warning">Desert Safari</h2>
      <p>
        Deserts are extreme environments where unique flora and fauna have adapted to survive with minimal water.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-dark text-white p-4 my-3 border border-primary card-box">
      <h2 class="text-primary">Arctic Tundra</h2>
      <p>
        The tundra is a vast, icy expanse where species like polar bears and arctic foxes brave freezing winds.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-secondary text-white p-4 my-3 border border-light card-box">
      <h2>Eco-Explorer Guidelines</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Leave no trace behind on trails</li>
        <li>Respect wild animal habitats</li>
        <li>Use reusable containers and gear</li>
        <li>Stay on designated paths to protect flora</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="container-fluid bg-success text-white p-3 my-4 text-center">
    <p class="mb-0 font-weight-bold">Nature Tip: Every small conservation action helps preserve our planet's biodiversity.</p>
  </div>

</body>
</html>